    "title": "Dataset for testing unit commitment models of CHCP plants",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10875471",
    "publication_date": "2024-03-26",
    "description": "<p>Zipped set of 365 JSON files, one for each day of year 2022, containing fictional but realistic data for a combined heat, power and cooling generation plant:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>heat_demand: heat demand in kWh</li>\n<li>cooling_demand: cooling demand in kWh</li>\n<li>electricity_purchase: price for purchasing electricity in &euro;/MWh</li>\n<li>electricity_selling: price for selling electricity in &euro;/MWh</li>\n<li>gas_purchase: price for natural gas in &euro;/MWh</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
